<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portfólio - José de Ribamar Marinho</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@24,400,0,0" />
    
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; }
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a192f 0%, #000000 100%);
            min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #ffffff; padding: 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border: 2px solid #009c3b; border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 30px; width: 100%; max-width: 380px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 156, 59, 0.2);
        }
        .foto-perfil {
            width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 50%; border: 4px solid #ffdf00;
            object-fit: cover; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: #002776;
        }
        h1 { font-size: 24px; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .cargo { font-size: 14px; color: #ffdf00; margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px; }
        
        .sobre-mim {
            font-size: 14px; color: #cccccc; margin-bottom: 25px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 0 10px;
        }

        .menu { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
        .menu a {
            text-decoration: none; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid #009c3b; padding: 12px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .menu a:hover { background: #002776; border-color: #ffdf00; transform: translateY(-2px); }
        
        .redes-sociais {
            margin-top: 25px; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 15px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); padding-top: 20px;
        }
        .redes-sociais a {
            color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .redes-sociais a:hover { background: #ffdf00; color: #000000; }
        footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #666; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="card">
        <!-- COLOQUE O LINK DA SUA FOTO AQUI. O link atual gera um avatar com suas iniciais. -->
        <img src="https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/initials/svg?seed=José+de+Ribamar+Marinho&backgroundColor=002776" alt="Foto de José de Ribamar Marinho" class="foto-perfil">
        
        <h1>José de Ribamar Marinho</h1>
        <p class="cargo">Desenvolvedor Front-end</p>
        
        <p class="sobre-mim">
            Olá! Sou estudante do Programa Trilhas e estou me dedicando a aprender Desenvolvimento Front-end. Gosto muito de tecnologia e de criar interfaces bonitas e funcionais. Seja bem-vindo ao meu portfólio!
        </p>
        
        <div class="menu">
            <a href="#">Projetos</a>
            <a href="#">Certificados</a>
        </div>

        <div class="redes-sociais">
            <a href="https://github.com/ribamarfilho053-web" title="GitHub">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">code</span>
            </a>
            <a href="#" title="LinkedIn">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">work</span>
            </a>
            <a href="#" title="Email">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">mail</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>Programa Trilhas • 2026</footer>

</body>
</html>
